      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62393928546a41082c280c5b|full_name}: You cannot control other player menu's. The background area is only for feedback reason how others have put up. \nAdd opacity slider in menu options is good idea how much you want see it. If you don't want see it, make it 0. See it a little and less disturbing? Make it like 20. Everyone can make own choices.\nIt's purely meant as visual feedback for others. You cant see menu contents, only blank area. No stats, no settings, nothing visible. Can set by default at 50% opacity.\nThe radial menu from avatars are less problem because we can see together fine, so visual blank circle is not needed here.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
